        "pwm_output",
        "led_neopixel"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED — despite the name, this is the WS2812/NeoPixel data line for a 300-pixel under-breadboard LED chain, not a plain on/off LED. Confirmed via two independent vendor firmware headers agreeing on GPIO17 (JumperlessDefines.h LED_DATA_OUT=17; LEDs.h LED_PIN=17, used directly in LEDs.cpp's Adafruit_NeoPixel constructor). main.cpp contains no plain digitalWrite/pinMode calls against this pin. See pfodWeb NOTE above and notes.txt for full trail."
